{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1fFeatures\ud83c\udf1f</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A cutting-edge(!?) alchemist simulator (probably) with an automatic item description and quest generation system!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone wants to be an alchemist at least once in their life, right? Well, now's your chance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You don't?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the boring chore of just following recipes and completing fetch quests?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry!! In this game, you can create whatever you can imagine to your heart's content!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's right, in this game...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791770/extras/c25166271ee5b7aca521f7fc7293523e.avif?t=1749731127\" width=800 height=580 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even create something like a &quot;<strong>Potato-Potato-Potato-Fairy.</strong>&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is that, you ask? I have no idea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, look! It seems we have a resident in need over there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where you shine! Let's deliver the wonderful item you just created!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Junk&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791770/extras/59d27403ee85d274bba40fb65d8fc6ea.avif?t=1749731127\" width=626 height=612 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.........</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seems like they were surprisingly impressed. You never know what will happen in life, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, what kind of items will <strong>YOU</strong> create to save the people of this world? ...Everyone is waiting for you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steams